          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDCD",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDCD"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Unlike my friends, don't think I'll fall in love again",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But I'll take a chance, seclusion isn't in my plans",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Pack my shit up, time I headed back out 'cause my shit's up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Spend it all in one out, wanna split some",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Some here with you right now",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "(Whatever you want)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "If you got cold feet, it's warm by the water",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "You can turn your page around, let me be the author",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Don't leave your destiny by the harbor",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "(Come on, it don't gotta be like that)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGHHF",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDDEFGGE"
    },
